    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get the compliance stuff, but i'm more worried about the bottom line. from what i've been reading, these rules seem to pretty much ignore how much they're gonna screw over smaller shops that don't have huge budgets. is there any actual data on whether these mandates are even effective at helping the environment, or are they just a massive cost burden for no reason?",
